From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:28:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 30/31] Lapin UX: Properties General page in the familiar
 layout, with Apply

Refs #143. The General tab shows the icon and an editable name, then
sections split by lines: Type of file and Opens with (Change... lists the
apps), Location, Size and Size on disk (or Size and Contains for a folder),
the dates written out in full, and Read-only and Hidden. Changes wait for OK
or Apply (greyed out until something changed); Cancel drops them. Renaming
and Hidden (a leading dot) go through the usual rename operation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
